ces" data-pc-name="selectbutton" pc7="" data-pc-section="root" data-p=""><button type="button" class="p-togglebutton p-component" disabled="" aria-pressed="false" data-pc-name="pctogglebutton" data-pc-extend="togglebutton" pc8="" data-pc-section="root" data-p-checked="false" data-p-disabled="true" data-p=""><span class="p-togglebutton-content" data-pc-section="content" data-p=""><!----><span class="p-togglebutton-label" data-pc-section="label">Tout de suite</span></span></button><button type="button" class="p-togglebutton p-component p-togglebutton-checked" disabled="" aria-pressed="true" data-pc-name="pctogglebutton" data-pc-extend="togglebutton" pc9="" data-pc-section="root" data-p-checked="true" data-p-disabled="true" data-p="checked"><span class="p-togglebutton-content" data-pc-section="content" data-p="checked"><!----><span class="p-togglebutton-label" data-pc-section="label">Dans le résumé</span></span></button><button type="button" class="p-togglebutton p-component" disabled="" aria-pressed="false" data-pc-name="pctogglebutton" data-pc-extend="togglebutton" pc10="" data-pc-section="root" data-p-checked="false" data-p-disabled="true" data-p=""><span class="p-togglebutton-content" data-pc-section="content" data-p=""><!----><span class="p-togglebutton-label" data-pc-section="label">Jamais</span></span></button></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-surface-100 pb-4 last:border-0 last:pb-0"><div class="flex flex-col min-w-60 flex-1"><span class="font-medium">Un de mes portfolios est retiré par la modération</span><span class="text-sm text-muted-color">Retrait avec motif.</span></div><div class="p-selectbutton p-component" role="group" aria-label="Un de mes portfolios est retiré par la modération" data-pc-name="selectbutton" pc11="" data-pc-section="root" data-p=""><button type="button" class="p-togglebutton p-component p-togglebutton-checked" disabled="" aria-pressed="true" data-pc-name="pctogglebutton" data-pc-extend="togglebutton" pc12="" data-pc-section="root" data-p-checked="true" data-p-disabled="true" data-p="checked"><span class="p-togglebutton-content" data-pc-section="content" data-p="checked"><!----><span class="p-togglebutton-label" data-pc-section="label">Tout de suite</span></span></button><button type="button" class="p-togglebutton p-component" disabled="" aria-pressed="false" data-pc-name="pctogglebutton" data-pc-extend="togglebutton" pc13="" data-pc-section="root" data-p-checked="false" data-p-disabled="true" data-p=""><span class="p-togglebutton-content" data-pc-section="content" data-p=""><!----><span class="p-togglebutton-label" data-pc-section="label">Dans le résumé</span></span></button></div></div></section></div><aside class="card p-4 flex flex-col gap-3" aria-label="Résumé"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold m-0"><i class="pi pi-inbox mr-1"></i> Le résumé</h3><p class="m-0 text-sm text-muted-color"> Les événements marqués « Dans le résumé » sont regroupés en <strong>un seul e-mail</strong>. Plusieurs événements identiques (par exemple des commentaires sur la même trace) n'y forment qu'une ligne. </p><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-sm font-medium">Rythme du résumé</span><div class="p-selectbutton p-component" role="group" aria-label="Rythme du résumé" data-pc-name="selectbutton" pc14="" data-pc-section="root" data-p=""><button type="button" class="p-togglebutton p-component p-togglebutton-checked" disabled="" aria-pressed="true" data-pc-name="pctogglebutton" data-pc-extend="togglebutton" pc15="" data-pc-section="root" data-p-checked="true" data-p-disabled="true" data-p="checked"><span class="p-togglebutton-content" data-pc-section="content" data-p="checked"><!----><span class="p-togglebutton-label" data-pc-section="label">Chaque soir</span></span></button><button type="button" class="p-togglebutton p-component" disabled="" aria-pressed="false" data-pc-name="pctogglebutton" data-pc-extend="togglebutton" pc16="" data-pc-section="root" data-p-checked="false" data-p-disabled="true" data-p=""><span class="p-togglebutton-content" data-pc-section="content" data-p=""><!----><span class="p-togglebutton-label" data-pc-section="label">Chaque lundi matin</span></span></button></div></div><p class="m-0 text-sm"><strong>3</strong> événement(s) en attente du prochain résumé. <br><span class="text-muted-color">Dernier résumé envoyé le 6 nov. 2026, 19:00.</span></p></aside></div></div>"`;

